---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Website Terms | Gibraltar For Sale" description="Terms and conditions for using Gibraltar For Sale.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Terms' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">Terms of use</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">Using this website</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-stone-600">Last updated 8 November 2026</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-8">
      <p>Gibraltar For Sale provides property guidance, area information and market analysis. By using this site, you agree to these terms.</p>
      <h2 id="not-professional-advice">No professional advice</h2>
      <p>Content is for general information only. It is not legal, tax, immigration, mortgage, investment or financial advice. Rules, prices, availability and personal circumstances change. Always consult qualified Gibraltar professionals before making property decisions.</p>
      <h2 id="sources">Sources and accuracy</h2>
      <p>Articles cite sources where appropriate. A citation does not guarantee currency or applicability to your situation. Market statistics, listing availability, agent relationships and developer claims are only published after verification.</p>
      <h2 id="waitlist">Waitlist registration</h2>
      <p>Joining the waitlist gives you email updates about verified listings, market reports and guides. You can unsubscribe anytime. We do not guarantee specific properties, prices or timelines.</p>
      <h2 id="external-links">External links</h2>
      <p>Links to external sources are for reference only. Their content and availability are controlled by the respective operators.</p>
      <h2 id="intellectual-property">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>All original content, design and code © Gibraltar For Sale. Area guides, buyer guides and journal articles may be shared with attribution. Commercial reuse requires permission.</p>
      <h2 id="limitation">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>We strive for accuracy but do not warrant completeness or fitness for a particular purpose. Use at your own risk. We are not liable for decisions made based on this content.</p>
      <h2 id="changes">Changes to terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. Continued use constitutes acceptance. Material changes will be highlighted on this page.</p>
      <h2 id="contact">Questions</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/contact/" class="font-bold text-sea-700 underline">Contact page</a> for enquiries.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
